"ResizeImage.dev（resizeimage.dev，2026 年 9 月）","tools.compress-wedding-photos.td_text.200_500kb_target_4_steps.5m6n7o8p":"200–500 KB 目标，4 个步骤","tools.compress-wedding-photos.td_text.basic_size_target_no_face.9q0r1s2t":"基本尺寸目标，无面部检测","tools.compress-wedding-photos.td_text.free_in_browser.3u4v5w6x":"免费，浏览器内","tools.compress-wedding-photos.td_text.not_offered.7y8z9a0b":"不提供","tools.compress-wedding-photos.td_text.7_modes_batch_jpg_png.5g6h7i8j":"7种模式，批量JPG/PNG/WebP","tools.compress-wedding-photos.td_text.compression_slider_lossless.9k0l1m2n":"压缩滑块，无损模式","tools.compress-wedding-photos.td_text.free_tier_subscription.1o2p3q4r":"免费套餐+订阅","tools.compress-wedding-photos.td_text.not_offered.5s6t7u8v":"不提供","tools.compress-wedding-photos.td_text.bulk_image_compressor.9w0x1y2z":"批量图像压缩器 (imagecompressr.com)","tools.compress-wedding-photos.td_text.unlimited_no_upload_no_signup.3a4b5c6d":"无限制，无需上传，无需注册","tools.compress-wedding-photos.td_text.basic_batch_no_face_aware.7e8f9g0h":"基本批量，无人脸识别","tools.compress-wedding-photos.td_text.not_offered.5m6n7o8p":"不提供","tools.compress-wedding-photos.td_text.multiple_files_seconds_batch.3u4v5w6x":"多个文件、批量、秒","tools.compress-wedding-photos.td_text.optimal_quality_slider.7y8z9a0b":"最佳质量滑块","tools.compress-wedding-photos.td_text.free_tier_premium_4mo.1c2d3e4f":"免费套餐 + 高级套餐","tools.compress-wedding-photos.td_text.not_offered.5g6h7i8j":"不提供","tools.compress-wedding-photos.td_text.adobe_express.1o2p3q4r":"Adobe Express (adobe.com)","tools.compress-wedding-photos.td_text.img2go.1c2d3e4f":"Img2Go (img2go.com)","tools.compress-wedding-photos.td_text.iloveimg.9q0r1s2t":"iLoveIMG (iloveimg.com)","tools.compress-wedding-photos.td_text.free.1i2j3k4l":"免费","tools.compress-wedding-photos.label_text.target_size.5x7y9z1":"目标体积（MB）—— 可选","tools.compress-wedding-photos.small_text.target_size.6a8b0c2d":"0 表示关闭。填写后质量滑块会被忽略，每张照片都会被调整到刚好小于这个体积。","tools.compress-wedding-photos.label_text.keep_exif.9e3f1a2b":"保留 EXIF 元数据（相机、日期）","tools.compress-wedding-photos.small_text.keep_exif.0c4d2e3f":"从原文件复制。仅适用于 JPG 输出。方向标记会被重置，所以照片绝不会变成横躺。","tools.compress-wedding-photos.p_text.what_it_does.7h2k4m6n":"压缩器用浏览器内置的 <strong>Canvas API</strong> 按你选择的画质重新编码每一张拖入的图片。它支持 JPG、PNG、WebP 输入，输出 JPG、WebP、PNG、<strong>AVIF</strong> 或 <strong>WebP 无损</strong>。可选的「最长边上限」会限制最长边——知道目标平台的尺寸限制时很有用。<strong>目标体积</strong>（MB）会完全取代质量滑块：工具会自动搜索仍能塞进这个体积的最高画质，只有当连最低画质都超限时才会缩小照片。AVIF 是这五种里最小的，但没有任何浏览器能自己编码它，所以第一次选择它时会一次性下载 3.4 MB 的编码器，之后就留在你的浏览器缓存里。WebP 无损适合平面图形——用在照片上反而会生成更大的文件。无论选哪一种，处理都仍然在你的设备上完成，不会上传任何东西。","tools.compress-wedding-photos.p_text.what_it_does_not.8j3l5n7p":"它做不到的事：无法达到比照片本身更小的目标体积，也无法写入 PNG 元数据。EXIF 会从原文件复制过来——相机、镜头、拍摄日期——所以压缩后的照片仍然记录着它是在何时何地拍摄的。方向标记会被刻意重置，因为像素本身已经是正的：保留原来的旋转标记会让每个查看器把照片再转一次。EXIF 只会随 JPG 一起保留；AVIF 和 WebP 输出不写入这些信息。","tools.compress-wedding-photos.td_text.40mb_upload_cap_1by1.5s6t7u8v":"<strong>单张上传上限 40 MB，逐个处理</strong>","tools.compress-wedding-photos.td_text.weddingaivideo_faceaware.1u2v3w4x":"<strong>WeddingAI.video 压缩器</strong>（本工具）","tools.compress-wedding-photos.label_text.output_format.a4b5c6d7":"输出格式","tools.compress-wedding-photos.option_text.c06b8c68":"JPG（体积更小，推荐用于分享）","tools.compress-wedding-photos.option_text.1724a385":"WebP（体积更小，现代浏览器）","tools.compress-wedding-photos.option_text.babb5986":"PNG（无损，文件最大）","tools.compress-wedding-photos.option_text.b6c7d8e9":"AVIF（文件最小 —— 需一次性下载 3.4 MB 编码器）","tools.compress-wedding-photos.option_text.c7d8e9f0":"WebP 无损（适合图形 —— 照片反而会变大）"}